{"1884660": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Echoes: A Transmissions Story", "steam_appid": 1884660, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by acclaimed artist Matt Dixon’s Transmissions illustrations, Echoes is an emotional and colourful 3D platform adventure about a curious little robot on a journey of self-discovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guided by the transmissions of The Creator, you must take control of the robot and journey across a whimsical world, uncovering moments and echoes that will help you understand who you are and where you’re going.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1884660/extras/7e53dda964c154b555a5f7d0e4e6e399.avif?t=1787231641\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1884660/extras_big/7e53dda964c154b555a5f7d0e4e6e399.webp?t=1787231641 width=1560 height=157 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1884660/extras/d5d231c07499b619cda426e0ccb823b7.poster.avif?t=1787231641\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1884660/extras/d5d231c07499b619cda426e0ccb823b7.webm?t=1787231641\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1884660/extras/d5d231c07499b619cda426e0ccb823b7.mp4?t=1787231641\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Traverse a beautifully melancholic landscape teeming with eccentric characters who are scattered like remnants of a world long passed. Help them resolve their lingering troubles and unlock the robots' lost memories.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1884660/extras/52c3a11dad888d2e75cb2be80f7827ff.avif?t=1787231641\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1884660/extras_big/52c3a11dad888d2e75cb2be80f7827ff.webp?t=1787231641 width=1560 height=157 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1884660/extras/dfc96735f593f8b52e1c68be07fcca90.poster.avif?t=1787231641\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1884660/extras/dfc96735f593f8b52e1c68be07fcca90.webm?t=1787231641\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1884660/extras/dfc96735f593f8b52e1c68be07fcca90.mp4?t=1787231641\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Use your trusty spanner to turn the world’s discarded junk into valuable scrap, which you can recycle into tools, trinkets, and upgrades that aid you on your journey across the wilderness.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1884660/extras/e187955e0918b71fda1bce2d53cdfdef.avif?t=1787231641\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1884660/extras_big/e187955e0918b71fda1bce2d53cdfdef.webp?t=1787231641 width=1560 height=157 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/s